&trans  &none   &msc SCRL_RIGHT    &mmv MOVE_Y(-2000)  &msc SCRL_UP       &none                                  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &mkp MB1  &trans
&trans  &none   &mmv MOVE_X(-2000) &mmv MOVE_Y(2000)   &mmv MOVE_X(2000)  &none                                  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
